 "review": {
  "management_type_reason": "MBG・種: 適した条件ではこぼれ種で攻撃的に殖えることがあると明記。商品は種そのものなので E。NC State の「不稔の交雑種」は交雑種の話で、この種の記述ではない。ただし「適条件では・ことがある」と条件付きなので低（E でなければ花後の刈り込みで B）。機械は B",
  "management_type_quote": "May aggressively self-seed in optimum growing conditions.",
  "management_type_by_matching": "B 花後刈込型",
  "heat_west_only": "弱",
  "muggy_west_only": "弱",
  "heat_muggy_west_evidence": "[MBG/種] Somewhat intolerant of the heat and humidity of the deep South, however, and appreciates some light afternoon shade in hot summer climates such as the St.\n[RHS/品種] Aspect: South-facing or West-facing or East-facing",
  "spread_evidence": "[こぼれ種 0／NC State・種] As a sterile plant it is unlikely to reseed（読み直し）\n[こぼれ種 0／NC State・種] It is a sterile hybrid plant, the result of a cross between Nepeta racemosa and Nepeta nepetella .\n[こぼれ種の食い違い] MBG は 3 相当",
  "mixing_evidence": "[MBG・種] May aggressively self-seed in optimum growing conditions.\n[管理タイプの見直し] 文を読んで隔離推奨型にしたので、強い（周囲を圧迫、配置注意） から 侵略的 にそろえた",
